# Codegen mirror — must match
# primitive-hdu-cartesian-plotter-rbnx/capabilities/lib/plotter/srv/Trajectory.srv.
#
# Absolute mm waypoints executed in order; z selects the pen state. The
# primitive applies the current global SET_PARAM profile and ACKs after
# the PLC reports motion done. On failure the gantry is left where it
# stopped (the PLC protocol has no soft-stop).
plotter/Waypoint[] waypoints
---
bool    success
string  message
uint32  points_accepted
uint32  points_completed
float64 elapsed_s